SUMMARY:Chiques Creek Tree Planting - April 23
DESCRIPTION:Greening the Lower Susquehanna is partnering with the Chiques Creek Watershed Alliance to replant about 200 shrubs along a restored section of Chiques Creek near where it crosses Rt 72 north of Manheim.  We will also be replacing the short shelters around surviving shrubs with taller protection to prevent deer browse.  Bring your own water\, gloves\, and snacks.  Please email Kristen at klk343@psu.edu to sign up and get parking instructions.
URL:https://lancasterwatersheds.org/event/chiques-creek-tree-planting-april-23/
END:VEVENT
