SUMMARY:10th Annual Octoraro Reservoir Clean-up
DESCRIPTION:On Saturday April 25th\, 2026 meet in the parking lot at Jim Neary’s Bait & Tackle (aka Fishing HQ)\, 212 Spruce Grove Road\, Kirkwood\, PA 17536.  Snacks will be provide\, courtesy of Kreiders Market.  Gloves\, trash bags\, etc. will be provided\, and it is suggested to wear boots and long pants.  This will go from 9:00am – Noon.
URL:https://lancasterwatersheds.org/event/10th-annual-octoraro-reservoir-clean-up/
LOCATION:Jim Neary’s Bait & Tackle\, 212 Spruce Grove Road\, Kirkwood\, PA\, 17536\, United States
ORGANIZER;CN="Octoraro Watershed Association":MAILTO:Octorarowa@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
