SUMMARY:Tree Planting in Elizabethtown - April 25
DESCRIPTION:Join the Tri-County Conewago Creek Association for a tree planting in Elizabethtown. They will be replanting a project that experienced some loss due to drought. About 70 trees will be planted. https://extension.psu.edu/volunteer-riparian-buffer-planting
URL:https://lancasterwatersheds.org/event/tree-planting-in-elizabethtown-april-25/
END:VEVENT
