SUMMARY:Replanting Hershey Pollinator Garden - May 16
DESCRIPTION:Help is needed at the Monarch Butterfly and Pollinator Conservation Area along Cocoa Avenue in Hershey to build habitat for Monarch butterflies and pollinators.  This year\, volunteers will be clearing older plots\, replanting with nectar plants and laying wood chips on the paths.  This is the 10 year anniversary of creating habitat! Join the celebration. Sign up at:   https://www.signupgenius.com/go/30E0C4BACAC2CA6F49-48475844-pollinator
URL:https://lancasterwatersheds.org/event/replanting-hershey-pollinator-garden-may-16/
END:VEVENT
