SUMMARY:Creek Discovery Day with Chiques Creek Watershed Alliance
DESCRIPTION:Creek Discovery Day: Exploring a creek and riparian restoration \nThe Chiques Creek Watershed Alliance is hosting an event as part of Lancaster Water Week to give participants a chance to learn about the plants and animals that are part of a 5 year old restoration project. \nhttps://www.chiquescreekwatershedalliance.org/upcoming/creek-discovery-day-exploring-a-creek-and-riparian-restoration
